      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "These bank statements are a nightmare, aren't they? To help you sort through them, I've grouped these transactions into 'needed' and 'nuisance' piles. The 'nuisance' list is probably full of those tiny, sneaky little pests you mentioned, like the ones that are just small, unpredictable charges.\n\n**Needed (Bills to Keep):**\n*   MYST *SUBSCRIPTION\n*   AMZN *RECURRING\n*   CLOUD *STORAGE\n*   SUBSCR *MONTHLY\n*   APPLE *SERVICE\n\n**Nuisance (Charges to Scrutinize or Cut):**\n*   SQ *TINY COFFEE\n*   VNDR *MISC\n*   MEMB *FEE\n*   DST *SERVICE\n*   SQ *LITTLE SHOP\n*   MISC *CHARGE\n*   SQ *SMALL BITE\n*   FEE *ADMIN\n\nYou should look closely at the 'Nuisance' list, especially the 'MISC' and 'SQ' entries, to see if they are worth the tiny bit of gold they're taking. If they aren't providing value, you should probably get rid of them!",
